  "title": "V2X Secures SHIELD IDIQ Contract from MDA to Support America's Golden Dome Defense System - V2X",
  "summary": "RESTON, Va., Jan. 12, 2026 /PRNewswire/ — V2X, Inc. (NYSE: VVX) is pleased to announce it has been awarded a contract under the Missile Defense Agency’s (MDA) Scalable Homeland Innovative Enterprise Layered Defense (SHIELD) indefinite-delivery/indefinite-quantity (IDIQ) contract vehicle. Under this contract, valued with a ceiling of $151 billion, V2X will partner with the MDA and industry to accelerate the […]",
